{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "数据检索与提取详解 · 三路并行归一",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "output": "docs/architecture/o3-retrieval-extraction.html",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "legend": {
      "mode": "hidden"
    },
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "retrieval-path",
        "label": "检索二路并行",
        "focus": [
          "property_spec",
          "database_query",
          "build_ads_query",
          "ads_search",
          "unpaywall_query",
          "pdf_download",
          "supplementary_query",
          "result_aggregator"
        ],
        "note": "子图2 B2 收敛版:START→[database_query ‖ build_ads_query] 并行;论文链串行 ADS→Unpaywall→PDF→CDS J+ →三路汇合;SIMBAD 由 P1 预填;关闭论文链消融时只走星表路。"
      },
      {
        "id": "extraction-path",
        "label": "多模态提取链",
        "focus": [
          "result_aggregator",
          "pdf_batch_converter",
          "vlm_batch_extractor",
          "bbox_batch_annotator",
          "figure_extractor",
          "result_builder"
        ],
        "note": "子图3 严格串行:PDF→图切片→VLM 白名单强约束→bbox 锚点→图检测+相关筛选→组装 records+图证;图证可点回原图页。"
      },
      {
        "id": "spec-channel",
        "label": "PropertySpec 中枢",
        "focus": [
          "property_spec",
          "database_query",
          "supplementary_query",
          "vlm_batch_extractor"
        ],
        "note": "PropertySpec=字段白名单+标准单位表:星表/补充材料列名归一目标;VLM 的 field_name 强约束;上传 PDF 合成 USER_UPLOAD_# 并入提取。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "lanes": [
    {
      "id": "paper",
      "label": "论文与补充材料路(子图2·论文链)"
    },
    {
      "id": "spec",
      "label": "统一中枢 PropertySpec · 上游产物"
    },
    {
      "id": "db",
      "label": "数据库路(子图2·星表)"
    },
    {
      "id": "extract",
      "label": "汇合 → 多模态提取(子图3)"
    }
  ],
  "phases": [
    {
      "id": "phase-retrieve",
      "label": "子图2 检索",
      "fromCol": 0,
      "toCol": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "phase-extract",
      "label": "子图3 提取",
      "fromCol": 3,
      "toCol": 5,
      "variant": "dashed"
    }
  ],
  "mainPath": [
    "database_query",
    "result_aggregator",
    "pdf_batch_converter",
    "vlm_batch_extractor",
    "bbox_batch_annotator",
    "figure_extractor",
    "result_builder"
  ],
